      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在某个午后——为了完成校内新闻特辑，\r\n美妙姿势与气槽穿着决胜负进行摄影工作。",
      "source_fingerprint": "71f2f5633a06a35ea346fe6db59b9ffed4546e7d436114f7d3c390adb6a08370",
