      "source_text": "……她一边戏弄着我，\r\n一边为她的决胜服发布会做准备。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fc8dca485baca9b3504ab9c0759db74d0c636e2bce41432e8b25e393646492b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
