      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不管怎么说，她可是王族。\n即便只是拿到决胜服这种事情，\n也能预想到报道的阵容会有多么夸张。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b377a306a7d87d2ca71ac221c85375e13d5c4e48e4fede8234528a18f1dbb6a0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
