      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我今天能有幸穿上这件决胜服，\r\n丝毫离不开各位的支持与声援——",
      "source_fingerprint": "a64977ce97c18c57c2cc3d90212ab479b6e4a787f983f37c8adfa2c499f7dd74",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
