    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a29cfbb88d40407819c423d8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "请各位再仔细瞧瞧这件决胜服。这件决胜服上，\r\n四处都缀着花语为『约定』的酢浆草，\r\n而这其中的含义自然不言而喻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9171f53957b82d8e698fcdb61f5e4070de798f3307991fbf6dd750f0806f6ee7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:290ce3e9f0188d51bd5ad5b4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "美妙姿势",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1cb551351a68022b5153ce22910be53e5784043168e94eb897bec2ce3a0afb0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
