    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9ee81eb8a9c20e7c47c17a6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这不仅仅是决胜服，更是我对祖国的誓约、\r\n是我心意的象征。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e71f52c2df5752e484a857bb205d42dbf4ac01ddebc44fafad9853d6a3fee3a5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:340b8b31677fed9e41541257",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "美妙姿势",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1cb551351a68022b5153ce22910be53e5784043168e94eb897bec2ce3a0afb0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89fb5ee567999f9b91736d2c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我心中的骄傲、我所追求的理想、\r\n我所期望的未来，都永远与祖国同在。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d59b9584992c16e3484728ec767779081695b0b1d216ce017a605d4fa1078d3",
